      "difficulty": "easy",
      "constraints": "2 ≤ [[W]] ≤ 80\n2 ≤ [[H]] ≤ 40\n([[W]] + 1) × [[H]] ≤ 1000\n-2.5 ≤ [[reMin]] < [[reMax]] ≤ 1.5\n-2 ≤ [[imMin]] < [[imMax]] ≤ 2\n1 ≤ [[maxIter]] ≤ 1000\n2 ≤ length of [[palette]] ≤ 70\n[[palette]] contains printable ASCII characters, without spaces",
      "coverBinaryId": 115248708966596,
      "stubGenerator": "read W:int H:int\nread reMin:float reMax:float imMin:float imMax:float\nread maxIter:int\nread palette:string(70)\nloop H write answer\n\nSTATEMENT\nDraw a box of the Mandelbrot set in ASCII art.\n\nINPUT\nW: width of the image in characters\nH: height of the image in characters\nreMin: real part of the left side of the box\nreMax: real part of the right side of the box\nimMin: imaginary part of the bottom side of the box\nimMax: imaginary part of the top side of the box\nmaxIter: maximum number of iterations\npalette: the characters to draw with\n\nOUTPUT\nH lines of W characters: the image",
      "inputDescription": "<<Line 1>>: two space-separated integers [[W]] and [[H]], the width and height of the image in characters.\n<<Line 2>>: four space-separated decimal numbers [[reMin]] [[reMax]] [[imMin]] [[imMax]], the box of the complex plane to draw.\n<<Line 3>>: an integer [[maxIter]], the maximum number of iterations.\n<<Line 4>>: a string [[palette]], the characters to draw with.",
